smb: client: parse DNS domain name from domain= option

jira KERNEL-814
Rebuild_History Non-Buildable kernel-4.18.0-553.115.1.el8_10
commit-author Paulo Alcantara <pc@manguebit.com>
commit 489d1523105e14e7a2c6e68205e05397e3b714fb
Empty-Commit: Cherry-Pick Conflicts during history rebuild.
Will be included in final tarball splat. Ref for failed cherry-pick at:
ciq/ciq_backports/kernel-4.18.0-553.115.1.el8_10/489d1523.failed

If the user specified a DNS domain name in domain= mount option, then
use it instead of parsing it in NTLMSSP CHALLENGE_MESSAGE message.

